(2)
The President and Secretary of every Bar Association and Advocates Association shall be responsible to the Bar
Council for the distribution of stamps to its members and shall maintain proper accounts pertaining to the same, and for
this purpose maintain a register showing the stock of stamps with the following heads, viz. -
(a)
Serial Number;
(b)
Date;
(c)
Opening Stock;
(d)
Receipt;
(e)
Issue;
(f)
Balance;
